      "summary_short": {
        "zh": "Ornith-1.0-35B-GGUF 是一个开放权重的 35B 参数对话模型，通过 GGUF 量化压缩，让大模型在普通电脑甚至边缘设备上流畅运行，解决了云端 GPU 依赖问题。其核心技术在于量化，显著降低显存占用与推理延迟，配合 llama.cpp 等运行时即可本地部署。由于采用 MIT 许可并兼容主流推理端点，非常适合开发者用于构建聊天机器人、离线私人助理或快速验证文本生成创意。无论你是想体验大模型，还是构建轻量级应用，这个模型都能让你低成本入手，并借助社区生态进行二次开发。",
        "en": "Ornith-1.0-35B-GGUF is an open-weight 35B-parameter conversational model quantized to GGUF format, enabling efficient local execution on consumer hardware. It solves the practical problem of deploying large language models without expensive cloud GPUs while preserving useful con…",
        "es": "Ornith-1.0-35B-GGUF is an open-weight 35B-parameter conversational model quantized to GGUF format, enabling efficient local execution on consumer hardware. It solves the practical problem of deploying large language models without expensive cloud GPUs while preserving useful con…"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "zh": "Ornith-1.0-35B-GGUF 是一个开放权重的 35B 参数对话模型，通过 GGUF 量化压缩，让大模型在普通电脑甚至边缘设备上流畅运行，解决了云端 GPU 依赖问题。其核心技术在于量化，显著降低显存占用与推理延迟，配合 llama.cpp 等运行时即可本地部署。由于采用 MIT 许可并兼容主流推理端点，非常适合开发者用于构建聊天机器人、离线私人助理或快速验证文本生成创意。无论你是想体验大模型，还是构建轻量级应用，这个模型都能让你低成本入手，并借助社区生态进行二次开发。",
        "en": "Ornith-1.0-35B-GGUF is an open-weight 35B-parameter conversational model quantized to GGUF format, enabling efficient local execution on consumer hardware. It solves the practical problem of deploying large language models without expensive cloud GPUs while preserving useful conversational quality. Technically, GGUF quantization reduces memory footprint and speeds inference, making the model accessible via llama.cpp or similar runtimes. With MIT licensing and endpoint compatibility, it's ideal for prototyping chatbots, private AI assistants, or offline text-generation tools. Developers can easily download and run it locally, or integrate it into applications via standard inference servers.",
        "es": "Ornith-1.0-35B-GGUF is an open-weight 35B-parameter conversational model quantized to GGUF format, enabling efficient local execution on consumer hardware. It solves the practical problem of deploying large language models without expensive cloud GPUs while preserving useful conversational quality. Technically, GGUF quantization reduces memory footprint and speeds inference, making the model accessible via llama.cpp or similar runtimes. With MIT licensing and endpoint compatibility, it's ideal for prototyping chatbots, private AI assistants, or offline text-generation tools. Developers can easily download and run it locally, or integrate it into applications via standard inference servers."
      },
